url: "https://01a032e3-4d20-64d8-c899-d46a976377ff.share.connect.posit.cloud/"
abstract: >-
  Public read-only interactive interface to the FibConsensus human skin
  fibroblast evidence framework. The Explorer provides access to study
  provenance, author-reported populations, marker evidence, adjudicated
  cross-study relationships, consensus architecture, atlas-based validation
  and disease-remodelling summaries associated with the frozen FibConsensus
  v2.2 scientific resource.
keywords:
  - fibroblast
  - skin
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - cell annotation
  - evidence framework
  - Shiny
  - interactive resource
  - FibConsensus
